        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Email Draft (Pre-seed Discussion)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Subject:** Scheduling Time to Finalize Docket TV Equity Structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi Rebecca and Matthew,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hope you're both well. As we continue to move forward with Docket TV—especially with funding and grant opportunities coming up soon—it's important that we finalize our equity structure clearly and fairly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'd like us to schedule dedicated time to discuss and reach an agreement on this. Having clear ownership and responsibilities in place will position us strongly for upcoming conversations with potential partners, investors, and grant committees."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Could you both let me know your availability in the coming week? I'll make sure to accommodate everyone's schedule."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Looking forward to this conversation so we can keep momentum going!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Best,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}